# Both lines are about selftest-invoke.invoke, not about the circuit.  The
# driver deletes every path named here before the run, so neither can be
# satisfied by an artefact an earlier run left behind.
#
# 'route notty' -- no -b anywhere on the command line, so the batchmode cp
# variable main.c:1032 sets is unset and the deck's .control block writes 0.
# The default route writes 1.
grep selftest-invoke.evidence batchmode=0

# 'flags -r selftest-invoke.raw' -- without the flags line there is no -r and
# no rawfile.
present selftest-invoke.raw
